      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "her",
          "body": "Seeing my friends now they all ask how things are going w you. And thought I\u2019d share my reflection w you. Last time I came I already felt pretty stable and secure and that hasn\u2019t been the main change. Main progression IMO from this visit was an increased level of comfort and openness, and fewer barriers/walls. Like being able to talk about a shared future openly - most noteworthy progression IMO. Moving toward talking more openly about convos we have w our families involving each other is part of that. And doing regular things like changing and farting lol in front of each other. Lowkey the farting one is important for me cus it hasn\u2019t been much of an issue but I tend to get gassy a lot based on diet lmao."
        },
        {
          "from": "her",
          "body": "Oh and of course I love you is probably the most significant progression / milestone haha"
        }
      ]
